> Simple example: encode, pad and recover a tight box

Let a proposal have centre `(ay,ax)` and extent `(ah,aw)`, and its target have
`(by,bx,bh,bw)`. Encoding gives `dy=(by-ay)/(.1*ah)`,
`dx=(bx-ax)/(.1*aw)`, `dh=log(bh/ah)/.2`, `dw=log(bw/aw)/.2`.
Decoding adds centre offsets and exponentiates size offsets; the core clips
log scales above 4. The fixture lies inside that clipping region, so known
target offsets recover the target to rounding precision.

For classification, R-CNN pads each proposal by seven percent of its own height
and width on every side. It then warps the padded rectangle anisotropically to
28x28. This differs from the baseline's enlarged square crop. The plotted
refinement below uses known target offsets, not a fitted prediction; the actual
learned regression comparison comes after training.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/rcnn_coding.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>

#include <print>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  namespace m = n::models;
  const auto a = n::from_vector(std::vector<double>{10, 12, 28, 30}, {1, 4}),
             target = n::from_vector(std::vector<double>{8, 10, 30, 34}, {1, 4});
  const auto offsets = n::encode_boxes(a, target), recovered = n::decode_boxes(a, offsets),
             padded = m::PadDetectionBoxes(a, .07);
  const double error = n::max(n::abs(recovered - target)).item();
  if (error > 1e-12)
    return 1;
  const auto canvas = n::zeros({1, 42, 44, 1}, a.dtype());
  const auto plain = m::DrawDetectionBoxes(canvas, {a}, {1, .15, .15}),
             with_padding = m::DrawDetectionBoxes(canvas, {padded}, {.15, .4, 1.}),
             exact = m::DrawDetectionBoxes(canvas, {recovered}, {.1, 1, .2});
  const auto background = n::zeros({1, 42, 44, 3}, a.dtype());
  const auto first = n::maximum(plain, with_padding), second = n::maximum(plain, exact);
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  n::save_image_grid(n::concat({first, second}, 0), "build/rcnn_coding.png", 2, 0., 1., 4, 1.,
                     4);
  std::print(
      "Known dy/dx/dh/dw: {:.6f}, {:.6f}, {:.6f}, {:.6f}; decoding maximum error {:.12f}. "
      "Left red proposal/blue padded crop; right red proposal/green known target.\n",
      offsets.at({0, 0}), offsets.at({0, 1}), offsets.at({0, 2}), offsets.at({0, 3}), error);
}
```
