refined: 15.625 candidates/image, proposal recall .5/.7 0.869565/0.739130; inclusive VOC AP50 0.682429, COCO AP75 0.505146, AP50:95 0.428570; 93 retained detections.
Eight official-test-derived scenes contain 23 target digits. Green outlines are truth; red outlines are refined detections, regardless of confidence/class correctness. Overlapping red boxes may belong to different predicted classes.
